Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Breadcrumb|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add ADT Via Breadcrumb
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Breadcrumb,Content and Appliation Templates|
	When Page add
		|pageName|Page Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Breadcrumb|
	And ApplicationDisplayTemplates add Portlet ADT With Field Entry
		|fieldName|Breadcrumb Entry|
		|portletName|Breadcrumb|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Name|
	And ApplicationDisplayTemplates select Portlet ADT
		|adtType|Breadcrumb|
		|portletName|Breadcrumb|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Breadcrumb|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'IFrame#CONFIGURATION'
	Then AssertElementPresent the value 'Breadcrumb Test ADT' at locator 'Select#DISPLAY_TEMPLATE'
Scenario: Configure No Save
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|Breadcrumb#ConfigureNoSave|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Breadcrumb|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Parent Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add Child
		|page|Public Pages|
		|pageName|Parent Page Name|
		|siteChildPageName|Child Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page goto Child Page PG
		|childPageName|Child Page Name|
		|pageName|Parent Page Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Breadcrumb|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And Breadcrumb configure Breadcrumb
		|uncheckSetupName|Show Current Site,Show Guest Site,Show Page,Show Parent Sites,Show Application Breadcrumb|
	And Breadcrumb view Configuration Preview
		|breadcrumbListNotVisible|Liferay,Site Name,Parent Page Name,Child Page Name|
	And Breadcrumb configure Breadcrumb
		|checkSetupName|Show Current Site,Show Guest Site,Show Page,Show Parent Sites,Show Application Breadcrumb|
		|configureWithoutSave|true|
	Then Breadcrumb view Configuration Preview
		|breadcrumbListVisible|Liferay,Site Name,Parent Page Name,Child Page Name|
